# Client Fabric

- Mod id `phantasmon`, display name `Phantasmon`, packages `com.mystaria.phantasmon`.
- `fabric.mod.json` must keep `"environment": "client"`.
- No `MinecraftServer` mixins, no server entity registration for ghosts.
- Assets live under `assets/phantasmon/`. Lang: `fr_fr` + `en_us`.
